ddress><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NASHIDA TATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, MOTOKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NASHIDA, TATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An information providing device and an information providing method, wherein a display is switched via a transition screen using a zoom-in screen and a zoom-out screen of a menu screen and the menu screen is scrolled so as to display a focused icon in a preset position, thereby making it possible to enhance an ease-of-use even if many programs are provided by being applied to a set-top box of a digital satellite broadcasting.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif et un procédé de délivrance d'information dans lesquels un affichage est commuté via un écran de transition à l'aide d'écrans zoom avant et zoom arrière d'un écran menu. Cet écran menu est mis en mode défilement afin d'afficher un icône focalisé dans une position préétablie, ce qui améliore la facilité d'utilisation même dans le cas ou de nombreux programmes sont envoyés au décodeur d'un système de diffusion numérique par satellite.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the term